p2p: remove obsolete waitForPeerProtocol helpers

The peerstore-polling waitForPeerProtocol methods are no longer used by
production code; the transports now use p2putil.OpenProtocolStream probes
and host.NewStream. Remove the unused methods from agentrpc and agenttask
and switch agentrpc tests to the Supported probe.

